    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Help us grow</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823310/extras/f4bc2ca8a52ea33c56d7ba4506e56627.avif?t=1755327296\" width=616 height=130 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2800</h2></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823310/extras/20d1bc0a9f056656c0702aaab43eb9f4.avif?t=1755327296\" width=616 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a fantasy world where players shape the environment through fighting, craft, trade, building, and exploring. No loading screens. No hard pay-to-win mechanics, just skill, strategy and freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your adventure begins on Soul Island a mysterious place where lost souls seek redemption. You will be called to demonstrate your strength and potential in order to gain the opportunity to redeem your soul with the help of the Angel, only then will you choose your vocation:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warrior</strong> \u2013 masters of melee combat, built for direct confrontation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Archer</strong> \u2013 focus on ranged weapons blending with some magic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wizard</strong> \u2013 wielders of destructive elemental forces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shaman</strong> \u2013 a support-focused hybrid, wielding healing and some offensives</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each vocation offers a distinct experience with its own strengths, spells and tactical depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823310/extras/a8c1c6265ef024b593be7524afc59c2d.avif?t=1755327296\" width=616 height=616 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey doesn't end with combat and questing. As you progress you can take your place in the world. Whether you rent a room in a bustling city or <strong>terraform your own island</strong>, you can build, customize and create your home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823310/extras/6a5bad82eae8c4c699d973d395cdf3be.avif?t=1755327296\" width=616 height=616 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft powerful equipment and tools to fuel your adventures or trade with other players. The economy grows through player-driven <strong>crafting and commerce</strong>, making every item produced and trade negotiation meaningful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823310/extras/e99eaf03109e8c091569c3ed3bdddb8f.avif?t=1755327296\" width=616 height=616 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition the game features <strong>three distinct perspective</strong> modes, allowing players to tailor the experience to their preferences, some offer a more old-school feel, while others present a modern isometric look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823310/extras/ee6d7faaa04471ac883d9b1c32069a3f.avif?t=1755327296\" width=616 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823310/extras/bc68ce394e61607b0b32ec2ed8318a41.avif?t=1755327296\" width=616 height=616 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823310/extras/718385d303c86c0398b46ac13bc084fe.avif?t=1755327296\" width=616 height=616 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823310/extras/8378ada180165aa10ba90811801e8009.avif?t=1755327296\" width=616 height=616 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823310/extras/8779048336c3fc39886857978f51c5a0.avif?t=1755327296\" width=616 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord to stay up to date with the latest news and updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can find the link to our Discord server a little below the start of the Steam page on the right side in the App Details column. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823310/extras/20d1bc0a9f056656c0702aaab43eb9f4.avif?t=1755327296\" width=616 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a fantasy world where players shape the environment through fighting, craft, trade, building, and exploring. No loading screens. No hard pay-to-win mechanics, just skill, strategy and freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your adventure begins on Soul Island a mysterious place where lost souls seek redemption. You will be called to demonstrate your strength and potential in order to gain the opportunity to redeem your soul with the help of the Angel, only then will you choose your vocation:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warrior</strong> \u2013 masters of melee combat, built for direct confrontation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Archer</strong> \u2013 focus on ranged weapons blending with some magic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wizard</strong> \u2013 wielders of destructive elemental forces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shaman</strong> \u2013 a support-focused hybrid, wielding healing and some offensives</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each vocation offers a distinct experience with its own strengths, spells and tactical depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823310/extras/a8c1c6265ef024b593be7524afc59c2d.avif?t=1755327296\" width=616 height=616 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey doesn't end with combat and questing. As you progress you can take your place in the world. Whether you rent a room in a bustling city or <strong>terraform your own island</strong>, you can build, customize and create your home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823310/extras/6a5bad82eae8c4c699d973d395cdf3be.avif?t=1755327296\" width=616 height=616 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft powerful equipment and tools to fuel your adventures or trade with other players. The economy grows through player-driven <strong>crafting and commerce</strong>, making every item produced and trade negotiation meaningful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823310/extras/e99eaf03109e8c091569c3ed3bdddb8f.avif?t=1755327296\" width=616 height=616 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition the game features <strong>three distinct perspective</strong> modes, allowing players to tailor the experience to their preferences, some offer a more old-school feel, while others present a modern isometric look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823310/extras/ee6d7faaa04471ac883d9b1c32069a3f.avif?t=1755327296\" width=616 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823310/extras/bc68ce394e61607b0b32ec2ed8318a41.avif?t=1755327296\" width=616 height=616 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823310/extras/718385d303c86c0398b46ac13bc084fe.avif?t=1755327296\" width=616 height=616 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823310/extras/8378ada180165aa10ba90811801e8009.avif?t=1755327296\" width=616 height=616 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823310/extras/8779048336c3fc39886857978f51c5a0.avif?t=1755327296\" width=616 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord to stay up to date with the latest news and updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can find the link to our Discord server a little below the start of the Steam page on the right side in the App Details column. </p>",
    "short_description": "An sandbox open-world MMORPG that brings back the nostalgic charm of the top-down view, offering demanding and engaging gameplay with modern graphics and pure, straightforward PvP, where combat, free from excessive visual effects, allows players to focus on the true dynamics of battle.",
